{
  "name": "Sync Event Total Session Hours",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Sync Event Total Session Hours\nKeeps a number custom field on each Event equal to the total length of its **published** sessions, so reports and certificates show what is actually scheduled.\n\n**Trigger:** Administrate *Event Updated* webhook (registered automatically when you activate the workflow).\n\n**Setup:** set `customFieldDefinitionKey` in **Config** to the key of a *number* custom field on Events. Set `deductLunchBreak` to `true` to take one hour off sessions of 4.5 hours or more that span 12:00-13:00.\n\n**Loop safety:** writing the field fires *Event Updated* again. The second run sees the value is unchanged and stops at **Value Changed?**.\n\n**Notes:**\n- Session times are treated as local times, so daylight saving changes don't skew durations.\n- Sessions are fetched 100 per page, up to 50 pages.\n- Only the target custom field is written; other custom field values are left alone.\n",
        "height": 988,
        "width": 436,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "dff1bcef-7980-41e8-a815-5b8e3d7d6da3",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Config\n- `eventId`: read from the webhook payload (`payload.node.id`). Leave as is.\n- `customFieldDefinitionKey`: the `key` of the Event custom field that holds total hours. **Replace before activating.**\n- `deductLunchBreak`: `false` by default.\n",
        "height": 556,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "438602ca-a060-4498-8ea0-b6c7e057d0c5",
      "name": "Inputs Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        480,
        432
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Pagination\nHTTP Request node uses native cursor pagination:\n- `first: 100` per page\n- `after` updated from `pageInfo.endCursor`\n- Stops when `hasNextPage` is false\n- Hard cap of 50 pages (5000 sessions) as a safety limit\n\nEach page becomes its own item, then `Extract Sessions` + `Split Out` flatten them.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 304,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "c900548e-72b3-43dd-b00e-bf2dca5d02cb",
      "name": "Pagination Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        864,
        432
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Integration logs\n`Build Success Log` / `Build Error Log` produce a log item with: `status`, `timestamp`, `eventId`, `eventTitle`, `totalHours`, `errors`. To keep a record, add a node between the builder and **Merge** that sends it somewhere (Slack, a sheet, a database, the Administrate integration log).\n",
        "height": 396,
        "width": 304,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "6d635b69-4823-4325-af8c-064117e257fb",
      "name": "Integration Logs Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1264,
        432
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "in-1",
              "name": "eventId",
              "value": "={{ $json.payload.node.id }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "in-2",
              "name": "customFieldDefinitionKey",
              "value": "REPLACE_WITH_EVENT_CUSTOM_FIELD_KEY",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "in-3",
              "name": "deductLunchBreak",
              "value": false,
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d82d1904-7740-4fb6-baf5-493fe7d8dcec",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        544,
        1008
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.getadministrate.com/graphql",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "administrateOAuth2Api",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"query\": \"query EventSessions($id: String!, $after: String) {\\n  events(filters: [{ field: id, operation: eq, value: $id }]) {\\n    edges {\\n      node {\\n        id\\n        title\\n        customFieldValues { definitionKey value }\\n        sessions(first: 100, after: $after) {\\n          edges {\\n            node {\\n              id\\n              title\\n              start\\n              end\\n              lifecycleState\\n            }\\n          }\\n          pageInfo { hasNextPage endCursor totalRecords }\\n        }\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\",\n  \"variables\": {\n    \"id\": \"{{ $json.eventId }}\",\n    \"after\": null\n  }\n}",
        "options": {
          "pagination": {
            "pagination": {
              "parameters": {
                "parameters": [
                  {
                    "type": "body",
                    "name": "variables.after",
                    "value": "={{ $response.body.data.events.edges[0].node.sessions.pageInfo.endCursor }}"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "paginationCompleteWhen": "other",
              "completeExpression": "={{ !$response.body.data.events.edges[0].node.sessions.pageInfo.hasNextPage }}",
              "limitPagesFetched": true,
              "maxRequests": 50
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "801de2b2-47c8-4f9d-b84c-ce5f92a2039a",
      "name": "Get Event Sessions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        752,
        1008
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "administrateOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Administrate OAuth2"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "ex-1",
              "name": "sessions",
              "value": "={{ $json.data.events.edges[0].node.sessions.edges }}",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "ex-2",
              "name": "eventTitle",
              "value": "={{ $json.data.events.edges[0].node.title }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "ex-3",
              "name": "currentCustomFieldValue",
              "value": "={{ ($json.data.events.edges[0].node.customFieldValues || []).filter(c => c.definitionKey === $('Config').first().json.customFieldDefinitionKey).map(c => c.value)[0] || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "8cc91d7e-cc07-4c9d-84c3-f125513968f3",
      "name": "Extract Sessions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        976,
        1008
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "sessions",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "6a2e2d64-25f5-4c09-8e74-baf81e4a7436",
      "name": "Split Out Sessions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1200,
        1008
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "d-1",
              "name": "durationHours",
              "value": "={{\n(() => {\n  const isPublished = String($json.node.lifecycleState || '').toLowerCase() === 'published';\n  if (!isPublished) return 0;\n\n  const start = DateTime.fromISO($json.node.start, { zone: 'utc' });\n  const end = DateTime.fromISO($json.node.end, { zone: 'utc' });\n  const totalHours = end.diff(start, 'hours').hours;\n\n  // Optional: subtract a 1-hour lunch break from long sessions that span 12:00-13:00\n  if (!$('Config').first().json.deductLunchBreak) return totalHours;\n  const lunchStart = start.set({ hour: 12, minute: 0, second: 0, millisecond: 0 });\n  const lunchEnd = start.set({ hour: 13, minute: 0, second: 0, millisecond: 0 });\n  const overlapsLunch = start < lunchEnd && end > lunchStart;\n  return (totalHours >= 4.5 && overlapsLunch) ? totalHours - 1 : totalHours;\n})()\n}}\n",
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1fa8e8d0-8d7e-4f75-a285-788fcb242364",
      "name": "Compute Duration",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1408,
        1008
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldsToSummarize": {
          "values": [
            {
              "aggregation": "sum",
              "field": "durationHours"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "265ac45e-b9a6-4eac-9961-691b82fd42ab",
      "name": "Sum Hours",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.summarize",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1632,
        1008
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "ft-1",
              "name": "totalHours",
              "value": "={{ Math.round(($json.sum_durationHours ?? 0) * 100) / 100 }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "ft-2",
              "name": "eventId",
              "value": "={{ $('Config').first().json.eventId }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "ft-3",
              "name": "customFieldDefinitionKey",
              "value": "={{ $('Config').first().json.customFieldDefinitionKey }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "ft-4",
              "name": "eventTitle",
              "value": "={{ $('Extract Sessions').first().json.eventTitle }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "ft-5",
              "name": "currentValue",
              "value": "={{ $('Extract Sessions').first().json.currentCustomFieldValue }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c7cdeeeb-56c9-497c-904f-b7693ba81fa3",
      "name": "Format Total",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1856,
        1008
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.getadministrate.com/graphql",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "administrateOAuth2Api",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"query\": \"mutation UpdateEventCustomField($eventId: ID!, $definitionKey: ID!, $value: String) {\\n  event {\\n    update(eventId: $eventId, input: { customFieldValues: [{ definitionKey: $definitionKey, value: $value }] }) {\\n      errors { label message value }\\n      event {\\n        id\\n        title\\n        customFieldValues { definitionKey value definition { key label } }\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\",\n  \"variables\": {\n    \"eventId\": \"{{ $json.eventId }}\",\n    \"definitionKey\": \"{{ $json.customFieldDefinitionKey }}\",\n    \"value\": \"{{ $json.totalHours }}\"\n  }\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
